From 7b2c9e1d4f6a8b0c2d4e6f8a0b2c4d6e8f0a2b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: m5agent <m5agent@m5stack.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 03:25:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hw/m5stopwatch: add Unit batch-10 a-class model subsets

Register the batch-10 a-class Units with reusable model subsets on the
reconciled canonical chain. Base is the 32-layer chain through 0151; this is
the 33rd layer after 0120 and applies at the chain end. All catalog/profile
entries stay planned; no guest/Device Service evidence is recorded.

- dcssr (U140): alias the official unit/acssr.py register subset at I2C 0x50
  inside CONTROl_ACSSR: 0x00 relay level, 0x10 RGB, 0xFE firmware, 0x20 address.
  The separate Modbus/RS485 mode and SSR electrical/isolation behavior are NOT
  modeled.
- puzzle (U193): reuse the neohex/hex RMT LED capture with 64 WS2812E LEDs on
  the PORT.B yellow single wire (white NC); no public Unit Puzzle driver and
  WS2812E-vs-WS2812C timing/order, optics and cascade direction are unresolved.
- dof6/dof9/dof10 (U228/U229/U230): BMI270-only fixture subset at 0x68 using the
  batch-7 US_BMI270 model (accel/gyro/temp/whoami). BMM350 0x14 and SPA06-003
  0x76 have no driver/register table in the frozen tree and are NOT modeled;
  dof10 does not substitute BMP280 for SPA06. Real motion/range/motion-detect
  physics are NOT RUN.
- asr (U194): UART 115200 fixture responder with a byte-layer AA55 <id> 55AA
  parser exposing command-id, plus tx-hex/frames-sent/frames-injected and
  responses-hex. Speech recognition/AEC/mic/speaker acoustics are NOT RUN.

ina226-1a is registered as a planned contract only (no QEMU model) because the
page has no register table and the TI datasheet is not pinned; the 11 b-class
Units are planned contracts only with no models or guessed registers.
Offline QOM smoke (S3 m5cores3, no guest firmware) covers the six model units.
